class: runtime
profiles: standard
summary: the library reference's common-tasks program named a file that is not there reports why on standard error in failure.words' phrase after the path, prints nothing on standard output and exits 1
program: ../library-common-tasks/main.ldn
run_args: missing.conf
run_expect: output.txt
status: 1
constructs: 0940, 0960, 1650, 1660
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
